ent-OmuRPObjectiveVandalizeATS = Vandalize the ATS
  .desc = You are tasked with creating a diversion by vandalising the ATS. We don't care how you do it as long as it's unusable once you are done. Glory to the Syndicate!

ent-OmuRPObjectiveBeStealthy = Be Stealthy
  .desc = Your handler has been doing budget cuts and is unable to pay coverup costs today. Make sure your objectives are complied with as quietly as possible, or at least keep your presence unknown!

ent-OmuRPObjectiveBecomeCaptain = Become Captain
  .desc = Become the new Captain of this ship. It's time we take over for the Syndicate!

ent-OmuRPObjectiveClimbCorporateLadder = Climb the ladder
  .desc = Become the new head of your NT assigned department, to ensure no records are flagged, the old one has to be demoted.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveSabotageComms = Sabotage a Communications Frequency
  .desc = We want you to take down as many coms channels as possible for a minimum combined duration over the shift of 6 minutes. Whack the telecommunications server until it stops working or eject the key, we dont care how you do it just make sure theres some downtime.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveCyberneticSmuggling = Cybernetic Smuggling
  .desc = One of our best operatives were caught and permanently incarcerated recently. Your duty is to gather tools and join their ranks for an eventual breakout. Use station resources to install an Cybernetic Arm Toolkit and get yourself taken to Central Command as a prisoner. Take care not to get yourself executed.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveDelamTheSM = Delaminate the Supermattter Crystal
  .desc = We're still upset that Nanotransen forcefully delaminated our nine supermatter setup. Pay them back by delaminating their own.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveDestroyTheTEG = Destroy the Thermo Electric Generator
  .desc = Nanotrasen has been flooding the energy credit market with Power Transmision Beams, we want you to stop this, at the source.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveKillXenobio = Clean Up Xenobiology
  .desc = Kill all slimes in Xenobiology and dispose of the corpses to slow down scientific research. You're basically doing them a favor.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveShowOff = Impress your Handler
  .desc = Your handler has noticed we haven’t been showing off well enough. Make sure your objectives are complied with in the most creative way possible today. This doesn’t mean kill everyone. Impress us.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveEmptyArmory = Empty Security's Armory
  .desc = Agent. You are to make sure that all weaponry available to security is no longer availible. You are free to do with the weapons as you please. Death to Nanotrasen!

ent-OmuRPObjectiveFifthColumn = Fifth Column
  .desc = Sabotage telecommunications, sow unrest and disinformation, undermine authority, facilitate infiltration by foreign agencies and don't get caught; operate in complete secrecy, have an alibi and don't be obvious, adopt a new alias when undercover; you're nobody and anybody. Ensure you are not captured alive.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveCommitFraud = Commit Fraud
  .desc = We want you to prove that Nanotrasen's internal security is terrible. Commit fraud and get away with it. You could promise to do something in exchange for a valuable item and then run off while keeping your payment, get yourself promoted or recognized by taking credit for the work of others, pass off as someone you are not to get access to or steal something, or secretly embezzle resources while going unnoticed. The choice is yours, but the more it will embarrass Nanotrasen when revealed, the better. Make sure to write a report we can plagariz- I mean, use to write an embarassing news article.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveHostageSituation = Take a Hostage
  .desc = Nanotrasen believes their crew are safe. Remind them this is not the case. Take a crew member hostage and hold them for at least twenty minutes. Command staff are encouraged, but not required. This is a message, not an assassination. Avoid killing unless the situation collapses.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveStealIdentities = Steal Identities
  .desc = A high paying client requests a copy of every command role identification card on the station. through any means necessary steal the identity card of every command operative in the station, kill them or leave them alive, you get their ID's to evac and the rest is up to you.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveCauseARiot = Cause a Riot
  .desc = Sow discord between the stations security and crew by causing some sort of disturbance that needs putting down. A riot, protest, anything that makes security take their riot gear out of the armoury will do.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveIncompMajor = Fake it 'till you make it
  .desc = We managed to infiltrate you on the station with this job, we know you aren't qualified and that's the point. Be incompetent, a minor inconvenience to your coworkers and crewmates, without getting fired.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveAiLawChange = Change the AI's Laws
  .desc = High command on your station has been boasting about their untouchable ai, show them we can modify it at any time we want to. Change the ai's laws with any lawboard atleast once, make sure you are the one doing it.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveRemoveSteel = No Steel for You
  .desc = You must deplete the station of as much steel as possible, remove the walls if need be.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveMinimizeFootwear = NoBoot Camp
  .desc = Agent, Your Objective is to Minimise the amount of footwear aboard the station, make sure there is less than 10 pieces of boots availible.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveNothingPersonal = Nothing Personal
  .desc = Eliminate a random crewmember and leave a business card by their body.

ent-OmuRPObjectivePowerOutage = Cause a Power Outage
  .desc = Cause a multi-departmental power outage that lasts at least 10 minutes. The longer the better.

ent-OmuRPObjectivePowerSinkDetonation = Powersink Detonation
  .desc = Due to recent reports about powersink malfunctions, we require you to perform a field test of one powersink from our current batch.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveSyndicatePresence = Make the Syndicate's Presence Known
  .desc = The crew were lied to about our lack of presence in this sector, let the crew know of our presence. Try to do it peacefully, ideally with propaganda and vandalism.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveSpreadPropaganda = Down with Nanotrasen!
  .desc = Produce and distribute Anti-NT Propaganda in the form of leaflets, syndicate merchandise, and leaked secrets, a reminder that emagging vending machines can give you free syndicate merch!

ent-OmuRPObjectiveHijackTheRadio = Hijack the Radio
  .desc = We've got a whole box of Syndicate ads going unplayed, so it's up to you to make them useful. Ensure that a Syndicate-branded radio disk is played at least 3 times this shift, so it really sinks in.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveRemoveMaints = Remove Maintenance
  .desc = Get rid of those maintenance shafts, those Engineers, Greytiders and Monsters would be better fitted terrorising departments than scrounging in the darkness all shift.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveReplaceTheAI = Replace the AI
  .desc = We want literally ANYTHING else to be the ai for your shift, dont ask us why. You will need two intellicards, one to download the current AI and the other to install a new intelligence. Remember that you can use the intellicard to download postronic brains or pAIs!

ent-OmuRPObjectiveNoWeldingFuel = Run on Fumes
  .desc = Deplete welding fuel reserves across the station. Either by breaking windows a smidge, or by stealing and marooning welding fuel stockpiles.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveDestroyTheSalvageShuttle = Destroy the Salvage Shuttle
  .desc = We're getting tired of wandering salvagers discovering our infiltration ships, listening posts and other spaceborne installations. Stop this.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveDestroyTheCargoShuttle = Destroy the Cargo Shuttle
  .desc = Nanotrasen shuttlecraft is getting too robust. Send their shipping fleet a message.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveShrinkTheStation = Shrink the Station
  .desc = Make sure the station is smaller at the end of the shift then it is at the beginning.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveStealCargoSilo = Steal High Value Cargo Silo
  .desc = The material silo cargo has is of high interest to the syndicate, your objective is simple, get the silo.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveUnsafeBar = Unsafe Bars
  .desc = Nanotrasen's bars are a safe space and their drinks are trusted. Ensure that most drinks consumed at the bar are spiked with psychedelics or poisons.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveUnsafeKitchen = Unsafe Kitchens
  .desc = Nanotrasen's kitchens are a safe space and their food is trusted. Ensure that most food consumed at the kitchen is spiked with psychedelics or poisons.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveAllThePetsAreMineNow = All the Pets Must be Mine
  .desc = The syndicate requires a bargaining chip of minor value, all station pets should suffice, steal and collect them all.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveStealAVehicle = Joy Rider
  .desc = Nothing is cooler than driving a stolen vehicle! Make it to evac while piloting a vehicle.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveSueNanotrasen = Sue Nanotrasen
  .desc = In the wake of the Space Court overturning Spess v. Weh, corporations are once again liable for damages caused on their stations. Capitalize on this opportunity by orchestrating or fabricating a situation in which Nanotrasen or one of its departments owes you money. This could be an excessive force case against security, an insurance fraud scheme against cargo, or anything else your evil little legal mind can dream up. The more time, money, and crew braincells expended, the better.

ent-OmuRPObjectivePromoteToRD = Get promoted to Acting Research Director
  .desc = The syndicate wants to prep an undercover agent for obtaining valuable research secrets in a later shift. Get yourself promoted to Research Director by any means necessary and provide us the perfect disguise.

ent-OmuRPObjectivePromoteToQM = Get promoted to Acting Quartermaster
  .desc = The syndicate wants to prep an undercover agent for embezzlement in a later shift. Get yourself promoted to Quartermaster by any means necessary and provide us the perfect disguise.

ent-OmuRPObjectivePromoteToCE = Get promoted to Acting Chief Engineer
  .desc = The syndicate wants to prep an undercover agent for stealing station blueprints in a later shift. Get yourself promoted to Chief Engineer by any means necessary and provide us the perfect disguise.

ent-OmuRPObjectivePromoteToCMO = Get promoted to Acting Chief Medical Officer
  .desc = The syndicate wants to prep an undercover agent for discreetly poisoning targets in a later shift. Get yourself promoted to Chief Medical Officer by any means necessary and provide us the perfect disguise.

ent-OmuRPObjectivePromoteToHOP = Get promoted to Acting Head of Personnel
  .desc = The syndicate wants to prep an undercover agent for getting our agents the right access and jobs in a later shift. Get yourself promoted to Head of Personnel by any means necessary and provide us the perfect disguise.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveVoxStation = Vox Station
  .desc = Vox have had to breath out of a tank for too long, its everyone else's turn. Set distro to only use nitrogen.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveTeachRealLesson = Teach <CREWMEMBER> a lesson
  .desc = <CREWMEMBER> has made one too many mistakes, its time we taught them a lesson they wont forget. Teach them 10 fun facts on a space station related topic of your choice.

ent-OmuRPObjectivePermaThisGuy = Get <target> into perma
  .desc = We don't care how you do it, make sure <target> is in perma forever, them showing up at centcomm in cuffs but not being a perma isn't a job done but its better than nothing.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveBorgThisGuy = Turn <target> into a cyborg
  .desc = <target> has said some things to a high command's personal cyborg they shouldn't have, show them what it's like and turn them into a cyborg.
